<ul class="bullet-list mb-3">
  <li>The beta uses your logbook. Anything you add, change or delete in the beta is real, and shows up outside the beta too.</li>
  <li>The beta has its own address, <strong>beta.climbinglogbook.com</strong>. Logging in at climbinglogbook.com takes you there.</li>
  <li>Each device downloads your logbook the first time it opens the beta.</li>
  <li>If you've installed Climbing Logbook as a Progressive Web App (<a class="text-accent-ink underline" href="/help/install/" data-apex-link>PWA</a>), install <strong>Logbook Beta</strong> from the beta address too. It's a separate PWA, so you can keep both.</li>
  <li>The hardest moves you write when opted in to the Check our beta channel are saved without your name or account, to help us improve how we read them.</li>
</ul>
